Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimePedestrianCrossing" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Pedestrian in yellow running attire crossing road" .
:actor2 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Pedestrian in white running attire crossing road" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Pedestrians crossing road without clear visibility due to nighttime" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Pedestrians intruding into vehicle path without proper crosswalk usage" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:trafficLight1 a :TrafficLight ;
    :description "Red traffic light at intersection" .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

